只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"In-process graph memory kernel for DeepSeek Harness, backed by TriviumDB.","id":"gh:1339347145","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-trivium","slug":"QWQcool/dsh-trivium","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","memory","triviumdb"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"In-process graph memory kernel for DeepSeek Harness, backed by TriviumDB."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-trivium — In-process graph memory for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"In-process graph memory for DeepSeek Harness. One `.tdb` per workspace. No extra server."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"The kernel stays close to DSH: no extra process, no extra nav by default. Pin memory fragments with "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"optional chip inject; the plot canvas is an optional extra, loaded from Settings."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> **Quick install**: `dsh plugin --profile web add dsh-trivium` → restart **dsh web** → open a works"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"pace (Settings shows **Trivium memory**; the **Chips** tab stays off until you turn it on). Details "},{"id":"p5s3","text":"hows **Trivium memory**; the **Chips** tab stays off until you turn it on). Details in Installation."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"**English** | 中文版"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"The published npm package is **0.8.6** (release notes): the context-pipeline release — observational"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" event scoring (scores are diagnostics; no event is removed or reordered), map heat, incremental map"},{"id":"p7s3","text":" injection with a per-turn key, stuck/recovered diagnostics, a visible deferred-write queue, batched"},{"id":"p7s4","text":" imports with an honest partial-commit receipt, fact identity (fuzzy merge off by default), `MemoryW"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"riter`, and inheritance/router behind an off switch. **The kernel does not change in 0.8.6** (`trivi"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"umdb@0.9.0`, already shipped in 0.8.5, which was the kernel-only release). See the documentation ind"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"ex for verification status."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"> **Back up the whole `.dsh` directory (with the plugin closed) before upgrading from 0.8.4 or earli"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"er** (0.8.5 and 0.8.6 already ship `0.9.0`, so there is nothing to convert if you are on either).\n> "},{"id":"p8s3","text":"0.9.0 raises the library format to **v10** and the previous kernel cannot read it\n> (`TDB_UNSUPPORTE"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"D_DATABASE_VERSION`), so **downgrading the plugin is not a rollback** — restoring a backup is,\n> and"},{"id":"p8s5","text":" a restore returns the library to the moment of the backup, losing everything written after it.\n[该节后"},{"id":"p8s6","text":"estore returns the library to the moment of the backup, losing everything written after it.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"> Prerequisite: install DeepSeek Harness and start `dsh web` at least once. Current Web verification"},{"id":"p10s2","text":" uses `0.2.1-rc.4`; see the baseline and evidence index for desktop `0.2.1-rc.3` coverage and limita"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"tions. Node must satisfy `^22.19.0 || >=24`; `triviumdb` is pinned to `0.9.0-beta.3`."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Restart **dsh web**. Memory lives in the current workspace:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Commit `trivium.jsonl`. Ignore the binary store:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Clone / `git pull` re-imports when the jsonl changed. Settings → **Git sidecar** is **off** by defau"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"lt (same as chips). Turn it on under **Settings** (the fold below Check for updates). The switch onl"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"y starts or stops auto-write. **Generate** (while on) overwrites `.dsh/trivium.jsonl` from the curre"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"nt `.tdb` at the same path. **Delete jsonl** (while off) removes known workspace jsonl files (`.tdb`"},{"id":"p16s5","text":" stays). Episodes, embeddings, and chip pins stay local."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"If you launch DSH with Dsh_BatStart, the plugin is installed for you — skip the command above."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Local source checkout:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"`npm test` needs no DSH host and never touches your real `~/.dsh/trivium.json` (each script gets its"},{"id":"p20s2","text":" own temp settings file). Pass a substring to narrow it: `npm test -- p8`."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Then restart `dsh web`."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Updating"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Before upgrading, stop DSH and back up the entire workspace `.dsh/trivium.tdb*` file group. Default "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"mmap storage also uses `.vec`, `.wal`, `.text`, and other sidecars. Git JSONL omits local-only data "},{"id":"p23s3","text":"and is not a complete backup."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Restart **dsh web**. For a source checkout, `git pull` then run `node scripts/link-dsh.mjs` again."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Uninstall"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Stop **dsh web** first so the `.tdb` is not locked, then:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Permissions and data"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"The plugin loads inside the `dsh web` process. It does not open its own port or extra service."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"| Access | Default | Notes |"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"| Workspace `.dsh/trivium.tdb` | read/write | Memory store. Do not open the same file from two Node "},{"id":"p33s2","text":"processes at once |\n| Workspace `.dsh/trivium.jsonl` | read/write | Git sidecar (off by default). Bu"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"siness nodes/edges only; no embeddings |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## Limitations"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"- If the model never calls `ctx_find` and no chips are checked, the window is mostly the opening sho"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"rt map.\n- Extraction misses things; dirty data can be archived / deleted on the chip strip or edited"},{"id":"p36s3","text":" / merged in Settings.\n- Do not open the same `.tdb` from two Node processes at once (one `dsh web` "},{"id":"p36s4","text":"is enough). The panel now says so instead of showing the raw TDB error.\n- **Supported window width: "},{"id":"p36s5","text":"900 px and up.** At 390 px the host keeps a fixed 188 px settings sidebar, leaving ~154 px for the p"},{"id":"p36s6","text":"lugin column (~106 px cards); the layout collapses but is not readable. Phone-width support is inten"},{"id":"p36s7","text":"tionally not claimed.\n- Markdown export is for humans; it cannot be parsed back. Git-friendly write-"},{"id":"p36s8","text":"back is `trivium.jsonl`, not Markdown. External import (WorkBuddy / Claude Code / Codex) is one-shot"},{"id":"p36s9","text":", not two-way sync, and does not ingest session jsonl dumps.\n- Do not merge `.tdb` in git (binary). "},{"id":"p36s10","text":"Track `trivium.jsonl`; ignore `.tdb`. jsonl merge conflicts are ordinary text — resolve, then reopen"},{"id":"p36s11","text":" the workspace.\n- The session layer (when on) projects compaction and fork; it does not split boxes "},{"id":"p36s12","text":"by message count. If the window has not reached DSH’s compact line, **Update checkpoints** will not "},{"id":"p36s13","text":"invent history boxes — use **Create checkpoint**.\n- Plugin setting toggles (chips / session layer / "},{"id":"p36s14","text":"git sidecar / recall / extract) save immediately. Embedding fields use Save; if a saved change does "},{"id":"p36s15","text":"not take effect, restart `dsh web`.\n- **0.5.0 writes JSONL `v: 2` and graph JSON `version: 2`.** Bot"},{"id":"p36s16","text":"h are additive and a v1 file still reads, but downgrading is not supported in place: an older build "},{"id":"p36s17","text":"ignores the revision relations and will drop them on its next write. To go back, restore the pre-upg"},{"id":"p36s18","text":"rade file group (`.dsh/trivium.tdb` plus `.dsh/trivium.jsonl`) rather than letting the old build rew"},{"id":"p36s19","text":"rite it.\n- A decision chain is linear in this release: one predecessor, one successor. Splitting one"},{"id":"p36s20","text":" version into several, or a fan-in, is refused instead of half-applied.\n- Deleting a replacement rel"},{"id":"p36s21","text":"ation from the JSONL file is reported as a conflict, not applied. Revoke it in the panel.\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
